          "id": "obj_ks_npTip",
          "name": "npTip",
          "control": "label",
          "rects": {"desktop":{"x":48,"y":688,"w":1180,"h":80}},
          "props": {"text":"Where the scripts live: three async page functions. parseDemo (data) uses @tonejs/midi only; playDemo (audio) does await import('tone'), Tone.start() to unlock the AudioContext, then a PolySynth schedules track.notes at note.time + Tone.now(); downloadDemo (file) wraps midi.toArray() in a Blob and clicks a temporary <a download>. buildMidi() builds the song once and all three share it. Repeat imports are cheap — modules are cached. 'tone' isn't on the shelf yet, so previews fetch it from esm.sh; add it with pnpm --filter @toolback/libs add tone to embed it offline.","fontSize":13},
          "on": {}
